<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>NewStreet Roleplay</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        /* Reset et base */
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; }
        body { background-color: #0b0f19; color: #ffffff; min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow-x: hidden; }

        /* Header avec fond animé */
        .hero-header {
            position: relative;
            height: 50vh; /* Hauteur du header */
            width: 100%;
            overflow: hidden;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1);
        }

        /* Les images du carrousel de fond */
        .hero-bg {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
            z-index: 1;
            animation: kenBurns 20s infinite linear alternate;
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            background-repeat: no-repeat;
            filter: brightness(0.4); /* Assombrit les images pour le texte */
        }

        /* Animation subtile (Ken Burns) */
        @keyframes kenBurns {
            0% { transform: scale(1) translate(0, 0); }
            50% { transform: scale(1.08) translate(-2%, -2%); }
            100% { transform: scale(1) translate(2%, 2%); }
        }

        /* Les différentes images à animer en boucle */
        .hero-bg-1 { background-image: url('https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1531037885145550918/1531044082040705174/image.png'); opacity: 1; animation-delay: 0s; }
        .hero-bg-2 { background-image: url('https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1531037885145550918/1531044082376511602/IMG_2079.png'); opacity: 0; animation-delay: 10s; }
        .hero-bg-3 { background-image: url('https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1531037885145550918/1531044475844034660/b6e1646d-f78e-4cdf-bb30-f3cbea3f7b71.png'); opacity: 0; animation-delay: 10s; /* Synchronisé avec bg-2 */ }
        
        /* Correction pour le fondu entre les images */
        @keyframes fade {
            0% { opacity: 0; }
            25% { opacity: 1; }
            75% { opacity: 1; }
            100% { opacity: 0; }
        }

        /* Appliquer le fade aux éléments 2 et 3 */
        .hero-bg-2 { animation: kenBurns 20s infinite linear alternate, fade 10s infinite linear; animation-delay: 0s; }
        .hero-bg-3 { animation: kenBurns 20s infinite linear alternate, fade 10s infinite linear; animation-delay: 10s; }
        /* Masquer l'image 1 quand les autres apparaissent */
        .hero-bg-1 { animation: kenBurns 20s infinite linear alternate, fade-out 10s infinite linear; }
        @keyframes fade-out {
            0% { opacity: 1; }
            50% { opacity: 1; }
            100% { opacity: 1; }
            /* Ce keyframe est vide pour forcer l'opacité à 1 tout le long, mais ça ne marchera pas comme ça avec la superposition.
            Simplifions : on va juste faire un fondu croisé entre bg1 et bg2/bg3. */
        }

        /* Simplification de l'animation : On utilise seulement 2 couches en boucle. */
        .hero-bg-layer-1 {
            background-image: url('https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1531037885145550918/1531044082040705174/image.png');
            opacity: 1;
            animation: kenBurns 20s infinite linear alternate, crossFade1 20s infinite linear;
        }
        .hero-bg-layer-2 {
            background-image: url('https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1531037885145550918/1531044082376511602/IMG_2079.png');
            opacity: 0;
            animation: kenBurns 21s infinite linear alternate, crossFade2 20s infinite linear; /* Léger décalage d'anim */
        }

        @keyframes crossFade1 {
            0%, 45% { opacity: 1; }
            55%, 100% { opacity: 0; }
        }
        @keyframes crossFade2 {
            0%, 45% { opacity: 0; }
            55%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
        }

        /* Le contenu du header (logo + titre) */
        .hero-content {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 10; /* Par-dessus le fond animé */
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .server-logo-img {
            width: 150px; /* Taille du logo */
            height: auto;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            filter: drop-shadow(0 0 15px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.5)); /* Halo violet */
            animation: float 3s infinite ease-in-out;
        }

        @keyframes float {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
            50% { transform: translateY(-10px); }
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 48px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff, #a78bfa);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        /* Reste de la page (Section principale et Footer) */
        .main-container {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 60px 20px;
        }

        p { color: #9ca3af; font-size: 18px; max-width: 600px; margin-bottom: 40px; line-height: 1.6; }

        .buttons-group { display: flex; gap: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }
        .btn { padding: 14px 32px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 650; text-decoration: none; transition: all 0.3s ease; cursor: pointer; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); }
        .btn-primary { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b5cf6, #6d28d9); color: white; border: none; }
        .btn-primary:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 6px 25px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.4); }
        .btn-secondary { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); color: white; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); }
        .btn-secondary:hover { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); transform: translateY(-3px); }

        footer { padding: 25px; text-align: center; color: #6b7280; font-size: 14px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="hero-header">
        <!-- Fond animé en boucle avec les images de bannières/personnages -->
        <div class="hero-bg hero-bg-layer-1"></div>
        <div class="hero-bg hero-bg-layer-2"></div>

        <div class="hero-content">
            <!-- Le logo principal (Logo_Fivem_N.png) -->
            <img src="https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1531037885145550918/1531044081747230830/Logo_Fivem_N.png" alt="NewStreet Logo" class="server-logo-img">
            <h1>NewStreet</h1>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="main-container">
        <p>Plonge dans une expérience de jeu unique sur NewStreet Roleplay. Rejoins notre communauté passionnée, découvre nos nouveautés et lance ton aventure dès maintenant.</p>
        
        <div class="buttons-group">
            <a href="/recrutement" class="btn btn-primary">Accéder aux recrutements</a>
            <a href="https://discord.gg/ton-lien-discord" target="_blank" class="btn btn-secondary">Rejoindre le Discord</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer>
        &copy; 2026 NewStreet Roleplay. Tous droits réservés.
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
